{"title":"Spirit Essence","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Wraith, Shade</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"shade\" title=\"Shade - dropped it in 3 of 5 looted corpses (1/1.7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/4eff2e68ec2f7fa73e76.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Shade</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.7<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"wraith\" title=\"Wraith - dropped it in 4 of 14 looted corpses (1/4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/aeaf0aa4188ec64745fd.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wraith</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"spirit-essence\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/tailoring\">Tailoring</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Used to make</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><a href=\"#/item/wispweave-feet\">Wispweave Feet</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Tailoring 31</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/wispweave-arms\">Wispweave Arms</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Tailoring 33</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/wispweave-head\">Wispweave Head</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Tailoring 35</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/wispweave-legs\">Wispweave Legs</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Tailoring 37</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/wispweave-torso\">Wispweave Torso</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Tailoring 41</span></li></ul>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/8875c6f441ed9a66c7ee.svg\" alt=\"Spirit Essence\"></div><h3>Spirit Essence</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      <tr><th>Used in</th><td>5 recipes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/15/2026, 9:10:09 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}